#: app/text.py:13
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hey there! 👋🌈\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to <b>CONQUEER</b> — where queer kings conquer connections! 💪✨\n"
"\n"
"Whether you're ready to:\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode</b> — Casual hookups and wild nights\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode</b> — Find your king or prince\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode</b> — Build your chosen family\n"
"\n"
"Your kingdom awaits! Create your profile and start conquering.\n"
"\n"
"<i>Be bold. Be proud. Be you.</i> 🏳️‍🌈\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"¡Hola! 👋🌈\n"
"\n"
"¡Bienvenido a <b>CONQUEER</b> — donde los reyes queer conquistan "
"conexiones! 💪✨\n"
"\n"
"Ya sea que estés listo para:\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Modo Fun</b> — Encuentros casuales y noches salvajes\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Modo Dating</b> — Encuentra a tu rey o príncipe\n"
"🤝 <b>Modo Friends</b> — Construye tu familia elegida\n"
"\n"
"¡Tu reino te espera! Crea tu perfil y empieza a conquistar.\n"
"\n"
"<i>Sé audaz. Siéntete orgulloso. Sé tú mismo.</i> 🏳️‍🌈\n"

#: app/text.py:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"🌈 <b>About CONQUEER</b>\n"
"\n"
"Your platform to conquer the dating scene — built by queer men, for queer"
" men.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Three Modes. Infinite Possibilities:</b>\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode</b> — No strings, just vibes\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode</b> — Find something real\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode</b> — Your queer tribe\n"
"\n"
"<b>Conquer On Your Terms:</b>\n"
"- Choose your role: Top, Bottom, or Verse\n"
"- Filter by age range and hosting\n"
"- Location-based matching\n"
"- Safe, private, and judgment-free\n"
"\n"
"Now go forth and conquer! 👑\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🌈 <b>Acerca de CONQUEER</b>\n"
"\n"
"Tu plataforma para conquistar el mundo de las citas — creada por hombres "
"queer, para hombres queer.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tres Modos. Infinitas Posibilidades:</b>\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Modo Fun</b> — Sin compromisos, solo buena vibra\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Modo Dating</b> — Encuentra algo real\n"
"🤝 <b>Modo Friends</b> — Tu comunidad queer\n"
"\n"
"<b>Conquista a tu manera:</b>\n"
"- Elige tu rol: Activo, Pasivo o Versátil\n"
"- Filtra por rango de edad y hospedaje\n"
"- Coincidencias por ubicación\n"
"- Seguro, privado y libre de prejuicios\n"
"\n"
"¡Ahora sal y conquista! 👑\n"

#: app/text.py:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>CONQUEER Command Center</b> 👑\n"
"\n"
"👤 My Profile — Own your presence\n"
"✉️ Invite Friends — Expand the kingdom\n"
"🎭 Enter Mode — Start conquering\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Centro de Comando CONQUEER</b> 👑\n"
"\n"
"👤 Mi perfil — Muestra tu presencia\n"
"✉️ Invitar amigos — Expande el reino\n"
"🎭 Entrar a un modo — Empieza a conquistar\n"

#: app/text.py:63
msgid ""
"\n"
"🎭 <b>Choose Your Conquest</b>\n"
"\n"
"What are you hunting for today?\n"
"\n"
"Pick your mode and start browsing:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🎭 <b>Elige tu conquista</b>\n"
"\n"
"¿Qué estás buscando hoy?\n"
"\n"
"Elige tu modo y comienza a explorar:\n"

#: app/text.py:74
msgid ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ready to play?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse hot matches\n"
"📭 - See who wants you\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Modo Fun Activo</b>\n"
"\n"
"¿Listo para jugar?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Explorar perfiles atractivos\n"
"📭 - Ver quién se interesa en ti\n"
"🎂 - Ajustar rango de edad\n"
"🏠 - Preferencia de hospedaje\n"
"💤 - Volver al menú principal\n"

#: app/text.py:88
msgid ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Looking for something real?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse potential matches\n"
"📭 - See who's interested\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Modo Dating Activo</b>\n"
"\n"
"¿Buscas algo real?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Explorar posibles conexiones\n"
"📭 - Ver quién está interesado\n"
"🎂 - Ajustar rango de edad\n"
"🏠 - Preferencia de hospedaje\n"
"💤 - Volver al menú principal\n"

#: app/text.py:102
msgid ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Building your tribe?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse friendly faces\n"
"📭 - See who reached out\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Modo Friends Activo</b>\n"
"\n"
"¿Construyendo tu comunidad?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Conocer chicos geniales\n"
"📭 - Ver quién te contactó\n"
"🎂 - Ajustar rango de edad\n"
"🏠 - Preferencia de hospedaje\n"
"💤 - Volver al menú principal\n"

#: app/text.py:116
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Profile Management</b> 👤\n"
"\n"
"🔄 Recreate profile\n"
"🖼 Change photo\n"
"✍️ Change description\n"
"❌ Disable profile\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Back\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Gestión del perfil</b> 👤\n"
"\n"
"🔄 Rehacer perfil\n"
"🖼 Cambiar foto\n"
"✍️ Cambiar descripción\n"
"❌ Desactivar perfil\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Volver\n"

#: app/text.py:129
msgid "Unknown command, king. Type /start to get back on track. 👑"
msgstr "Comando desconocido, rey. Escribe /start para volver al camino. 👑"

#: app/text.py:134
msgid ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Time to play! You're now browsing guys looking for casual hookups and "
"steamy encounters.\n"
"\n"
"Who's ready for you tonight? Let's find out! 🔥\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>¡Modo Fun Activado!</b>\n"
"\n"
"¡Hora de divertirse! Ahora estás viendo chicos que buscan encuentros "
"casuales y apasionados.\n"
"\n"
"¿Quién te espera esta noche? ¡Vamos a descubrirlo! 🔥\n"

#: app/text.py:144
msgid ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Looking for something deeper? You're now browsing guys seeking meaningful"
" connections and romance.\n"
"\n"
"Your match might be one swipe away! 💕\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>¡Modo Dating Activado!</b>\n"
"\n"
"¿Buscas algo más profundo? Ahora estás viendo chicos que buscan "
"conexiones significativas y romance.\n"
"\n"
"¡Tu pareja ideal podría estar a un swipe de distancia! 💕\n"

#: app/text.py:154
msgid ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Building your tribe! You're now browsing guys looking for genuine "
"friendships and community.\n"
"\n"
"Let's expand your chosen family! 🌈\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>¡Modo Friends Activado!</b>\n"
"\n"
"¡Creando tu comunidad! Ahora estás viendo chicos que buscan amistades "
"genuinas y compañerismo.\n"
"\n"
"¡Expandamos tu familia elegida! 🌈\n"

