msgstr ""
"No se encontraron perfiles en este modo. ¡Prueba ajustar tus filtros o "
"vuelve más tarde! 🌍"

#: app/text.py:273
msgid ""
"🍆 <b>No more profiles in Fun mode!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Try changing your age/hosting filters or check back later for fresh meat!"
" 🔥"
msgstr ""
