msgid "🍆 No one's crushed on you in Fun mode yet... but the night is young! 🔥"
msgstr "🍆 Nadie te ha dado like en modo Fun todavía... ¡pero la noche es joven! 🔥"

#: app/text.py:291
msgid ""
"❤️ No one's swiped right in Dating mode yet... but your person is out "
